<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) - Piet Mondrian</title>
<meta name="description" content="The story of Piet Mondrian's Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) and the De Stijl movement.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--red:#d40920;--blue:#1356a2;--yellow:#fac901;--white:#f7f5ee;--black:#111;--line:12px}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:var(--white);color:var(--black);font:18px/1.55 "Work Sans",Arial,sans-serif}
h1,h2,h3,.btn{font-family:"Archivo Black","Arial Black",Impact,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.02}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:4px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px}
.grid{display:grid;border:var(--line) solid var(--black);gap:var(--line);background:var(--black)}
.grid>*{background:var(--white);padding:clamp(18px,3vw,36px)}
header.top{border-bottom:var(--line) solid var(--black);padding:14px 24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
/* hero: asymmetric, echoes the 1930 canvas */
.hero{grid-template-columns:1.1fr .45fr .45fr;grid-template-rows:auto 150px 110px;margin:0}
.hero .title{grid-column:1/2;grid-row:1/3}
.hero .title h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,6vw,5rem)}
.hero .title p{margin-top:20px;max-width:34ch;font-size:1.15rem}
.hero .red{grid-column:2/4;grid-row:1/2;background:var(--red);min-height:260px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;font-weight:600}
.hero .white1{grid-column:2/3;grid-row:2/3}
.hero .white2{grid-column:3/4;grid-row:2/3}
.hero .blue{grid-column:1/2;grid-row:3/4;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;font-weight:600}
.hero .yellow{grid-column:2/4;grid-row:3/4;background:var(--yellow);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--black);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 26px;font-size:1rem;border:4px solid var(--black);transition:background .15s,color .15s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--black)}
main{margin-top:var(--line)}
section{margin-bottom:var(--line)}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.5vw,2.6rem);margin-bottom:14px}
h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px}
.facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr)}
.facts .painter{grid-column:1/8}
.facts .year{grid-column:8/13;background:var(--yellow)}
.facts .year b{font:400 clamp(3rem,9vw,7rem)/1 "Archivo Black",sans-serif;display:block}
.facts .movement{grid-column:1/6;background:var(--blue);color:#fff}
.facts .principles{grid-column:6/13}
.facts .matters{grid-column:1/13;background:var(--red);color:#fff}
.facts .matters p{max-width:60ch}
ul.rules{list-style:none;padding:0}
ul.rules li{padding:8px 0 8px 34px;position:relative}
ul.rules li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:14px;width:18px;height:18px;background:var(--black)}
ul.rules li:nth-child(2)::before{background:var(--red)}
ul.rules li:nth-child(3)::before{background:var(--blue)}
dl.meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:6px 18px;margin-top:12px}
dt{font-weight:600}dd{margin:0}
.cta{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr}
.cta .go{background:var(--yellow)}
.cta .go p{margin:0 0 20px;max-width:40ch}
.cta .b{background:var(--blue)}.cta .r{background:var(--red)}
footer{border-top:var(--line) solid var(--black);padding:20px 24px;font-size:15px}
@media(max-width:760px){
 .hero,.facts,.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:auto}
 .hero>*,.facts>*{grid-column:auto!important;grid-row:auto!important}
 .hero .white1,.hero .white2,.cta .b,.cta .r{display:none}
 .hero .red{min-height:160px}
}
</style>
</head>
